      "comment": "npm read operations. `audit` no longer accepts a bare tail: `npm audit fix` rewrites the lockfile and node_modules. `config get` of an `_auth`/`_password` key prints the registry credential `.npmrc` holds, which the credential floor denies to a read: refused (F1.292)."
